sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Owner UI
  participant P1 as S09
  participant P2 as S02 S07 S08
  participant P3 as Runtime
  participant P4 as Independent reviewer
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Choose fixed case guidance and roles
    P1->>P2: 2 Verify active profiles and same-purpose sources
    P1->>P1: 3 Reserve one attempt per required role
    P3->>P1: 4 Claim only assigned input once
    P1->>P3: 5 Issue exact verified bounded packet
    P3->>P3: 6 Journal intent before model invocation
    P3->>P1: 7 Submit output and every dissent record
    P4->>P1: 8 Review exact revision and complete outputs
    P1->>P2: 9 Reverify current source and actual files
    P1->>P4: 10 Retain advisory review and rationale
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: Unknown model usage stays null. Missing or abstaining roles block; dissent is preserved. Cancellation retains late ineligible output.
  end
